<title>FINLAND: ISKO SEES 1996 EARNINGS ABOVE 1995.</title>
<headline>ISKO SEES 1996 EARNINGS ABOVE 1995.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish tyres wholesaler Isko Oy said on Wednesday that it expects its 1996 profit to be above the 1995 level, unlike announced earlier.</p>
<p>&quot;The result is expected to be better than announced earlier and it is seen exceeding that of the previous year,&quot; Isko said in a statement.  </p>
<p>Isko said an increase in new car registrations had boosted demand for winter tyres.</p>
<p>&quot;Isko's sales in the last months of 1996 were better than expected,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Isko said it would publish its full-year 1996 results on February 17.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
